#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Guidance on key team roles, building skills, and technical best practices."
msgstr ""
"Panduan tentang peranan pasukan utama, pembinaan kemahiran, dan amalan "
"terbaik teknikal."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Assemble your team"
msgstr "Susun pasukan anda"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore  */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore  */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Assemble your team {#assemble-your-team}"
msgstr "Susun pasukan anda {#assemble-your-team}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Assembling a quantum team will likely be challenging, given the shortage of "
"people with experience in quantum computing. But are there strategies that "
"make it easier? Are some roles even more critical in early stages, and are "
"there best practices that can ensure the right people are on the team and "
"know their roles? Successful leaders of quantum projects say \"yes\". The "
"guidelines below have proven useful.\n"
msgstr ""
"Menyusun pasukan kuantum mungkin akan mencabar, memandangkan kekurangan "
"orang yang berpengalaman dalam pengkomputeran kuantum. Tetapi adakah "
"terdapat strategi yang memudahkan proses ini? Adakah sesetengah peranan "
"lebih kritikal di peringkat awal, dan adakah amalan terbaik yang dapat "
"memastikan orang yang betul berada dalam pasukan dan mengetahui peranan "
"mereka? Pemimpin projek kuantum yang berjaya berkata \"ya\". Panduan di "
"bawah telah terbukti berguna.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Key points**\n"
msgstr "**Poin utama**\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Establish and develop a quantum team: Build applied quantum expertise by "
"hiring and upskilling. \n"
msgstr ""
"Wujudkan dan kembangkan pasukan kuantum: Bina kepakaran kuantum gunaan "
"dengan pengambilan pekerja dan peningkatan kemahiran.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Identify team objectives and mission to drive success and alignment.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kenal pasti objektif dan misi pasukan untuk mendorong kejayaan dan "
"penjajaran.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Build partnerships that can help you meet your expertise needs. Identify "
"potential partners and members early. Develop the plan with your partners.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bina perkongsian yang dapat membantu anda memenuhi keperluan kepakaran. "
"Kenal pasti rakan kongsi dan ahli yang berpotensi lebih awal. Bangunkan "
"pelan bersama rakan kongsi anda.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Ensure that everyone knows their role in the larger endeavors.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pastikan semua orang mengetahui peranan mereka dalam usaha yang lebih "
"besar.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Establish a internal quantum champion to advocate for quantum computing and "
"keep the organization current on advancements.\n"
msgstr ""
"Wujudkan penyokong kuantum dalaman untuk mengadvokasi pengkomputeran kuantum"
" dan memastikan organisasi sentiasa terkini dengan perkembangan terbaru.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"It is worth reiterating that for any client-facing quantum initiative (such "
"as a QIC, startup, or quantum consulting group), it is a good idea to reach "
"out to potential members/clients early on. This is especially important "
"given the novel nature of quantum computing and the burgeoning quantum "
"industry, since new membership agreements can take a long time to "
"finalize.\n"
msgstr ""
"Adalah berbaloi untuk menegaskan semula bahawa untuk sebarang inisiatif "
"kuantum yang berhadapan dengan klien (seperti QIC, syarikat permulaan, atau "
"kumpulan perundingan kuantum), adalah idea yang baik untuk menghubungi "
"ahli/klien berpotensi lebih awal. Ini amat penting memandangkan sifat novel "
"pengkomputeran kuantum dan industri kuantum yang sedang berkembang pesat, "
"kerana perjanjian keahlian baru boleh mengambil masa lama untuk "
"dimuktamadkan.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Build and onboard a new quantum team {#build-and-onboard-a-new-quantum-team}"
msgstr ""
"Bina dan onboard pasukan kuantum baru {#build-and-onboard-a-new-quantum-"
"team}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In some cases, launching a quantum project will mean hiring team personnel, "
"and in other cases, you may already have internal expertise. The key thing "
"is to identify the roles that must be filled. It is also important to have "
"some idea of what full-time equivalent (FTE) is required for various roles, "
"especially when some key players are splitting their time between "
"projects.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam sesetengah kes, melancarkan projek kuantum akan bermakna mengambil "
"pekerja baharu, dan dalam kes lain, anda mungkin sudah mempunyai kepakaran "
"dalaman. Perkara utama adalah mengenal pasti peranan yang mesti diisi. "
"Adalah juga penting untuk mempunyai gambaran tentang berapa setara masa "
"penuh (FTE) yang diperlukan untuk pelbagai peranan, terutamanya apabila "
"beberapa pemain utama membahagikan masa mereka antara projek.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This might differ according to organization and goals, but there are some "
"very safe bets. Find your organization type below to see what roles have "
"been critical to success in the past, and recommendations of **minimum** "
"FTEs devoted to various roles. Some partnerships may require more.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini mungkin berbeza mengikut organisasi dan matlamat, tetapi ada beberapa "
"pertaruhan yang sangat selamat. Cari jenis organisasi anda di bawah untuk "
"melihat peranan yang kritikal kepada kejayaan pada masa lalu, dan cadangan "
"**minimum** FTE yang diperuntukkan untuk pelbagai peranan. Sesetengah "
"perkongsian mungkin memerlukan lebih banyak.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Academic institution, research organization, or QIC {#academic-institution-"
"research-organization-or-qic}"
msgstr ""
"Institusi akademik, organisasi penyelidikan, atau QIC {#academic-"
"institution-research-organization-or-qic}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The following are critical roles:\n"
msgstr "Peranan-peranan berikut adalah kritikal:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Domain or application subject matter experts (SMEs):** These are technical"
" experts who develop code, demonstrate the current state of quantum "
"computing, build demos and prototypes, and identify early applications. It "
"is advised to have experts in both quantum computing and in the application "
"area.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Pakar kandungan domain atau aplikasi (SME):** Ini adalah pakar teknikal "
"yang membangunkan kod, menunjukkan keadaan semasa pengkomputeran kuantum, "
"membina demo dan prototaip, dan mengenal pasti aplikasi awal. Disyorkan "
"untuk mempunyai pakar dalam pengkomputeran kuantum dan dalam bidang "
"aplikasi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Project manager/team lead and support:** These may cover a wide variety of"
" support and management topics, including onboarding new members, supporting"
" scientists with their work, delivering value to customers, and working on "
"strategic initiatives. Other specialized activities include "
"licensing/contract support, workflow, and compliance.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Pengurus projek/ketua pasukan dan sokongan:** Ini mungkin merangkumi "
"pelbagai topik sokongan dan pengurusan, termasuk onboarding ahli baru, "
"menyokong saintis dalam kerja mereka, menyampaikan nilai kepada pelanggan, "
"dan mengusahakan inisiatif strategik. Aktiviti khusus lain termasuk sokongan"
" pelesenan/kontrak, aliran kerja, dan pematuhan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Program manager:** A leadership role focused on technical implementation. "
"This person manages technical aspects of internal and external projects, "
"identifies potential research collaborations, and identifies application and"
" research priorities. Other activities include managing research funds and "
"grants, spearheading outreach, and generally supporting core research "
"functions.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Pengurus program:** Peranan kepimpinan yang tertumpu pada pelaksanaan "
"teknikal. Orang ini mengurus aspek teknikal projek dalaman dan luaran, "
"mengenal pasti kolaborasi penyelidikan yang berpotensi, dan mengenal pasti "
"keutamaan aplikasi dan penyelidikan. Aktiviti lain termasuk mengurus dana "
"dan geran penyelidikan, menerajui jangkauan, dan secara umum menyokong "
"fungsi penyelidikan teras.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Administrator:** A 'hub admin' is responsible for adding and removing new "
"members to the provider, assigning groups and projects, and tracking usage "
"for the organization. For more information on how administrators can create "
"and track user accounts, visit the [documentation](/guides/cloud-account-"
"structure).\n"
msgstr ""
"**Pentadbir:** 'Hub admin' bertanggungjawab untuk menambah dan memadam ahli "
"baru ke penyedia, menetapkan kumpulan dan projek, dan menjejak penggunaan "
"untuk organisasi. Untuk maklumat lanjut tentang cara pentadbir boleh "
"mencipta dan menjejak akaun pengguna, layari [dokumentasi](/guides/cloud-"
"account-structure).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Recommended **minimum** FTEs:\n"
msgstr "**Minimum** FTE yang disyorkan:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| At year zero (just starting up)               |    Recommended minimum FTE       |\n"
"| -------------------------------------- | ----------------- |\n"
"| Subject matter expert      | 1.0-1.5 FTE       |\n"
"| Project manager            | 1.5 FTE           |\n"
"| Program manager            | 1.0 FTE           |\n"
"| Administrator              | 1.0 FTE |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Pada tahun sifar (baru bermula) | Minimum FTE yang disyorkan |\n"
"| -------------------------------------- | ----------------- |\n"
"| Pakar kandungan | 1.0-1.5 FTE |\n"
"| Pengurus projek | 1.5 FTE |\n"
"| Pengurus program | 1.0 FTE |\n"
"| Pentadbir | 1.0 FTE |\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Enterprise organization {#enterprise-organization}"
msgstr "Organisasi perusahaan {#enterprise-organization}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Executive sponsor/advocate:** An advocate for quantum computing (QC) "
"within the leadership of the broader organization. This person has a vision "
"of how QC will revolutionize their field, and keeps abreast of latest "
"developments, but also manages expectations by accurately describing the "
"capabilities and constraints of modern quantum computers.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Penaja/penyokong eksekutif:** Penyokong pengkomputeran kuantum (QC) dalam "
"kepimpinan organisasi yang lebih luas. Orang ini mempunyai visi tentang "
"bagaimana QC akan merevolusikan bidang mereka, dan sentiasa mengikuti "
"perkembangan terkini, tetapi juga mengurus jangkaan dengan menggambarkan "
"dengan tepat keupayaan dan kekangan komputer kuantum moden.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Technical team (domain or application subject matter experts):** These are"
" technical experts who develop code, demonstrate the current state of "
"quantum computing, build demos and prototypes, and identify early "
"applications. It is advised to have experts in both quantum computing and in"
" the application area.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Pasukan teknikal (pakar kandungan domain atau aplikasi):** Ini adalah "
"pakar teknikal yang membangunkan kod, menunjukkan keadaan semasa "
"pengkomputeran kuantum, membina demo dan prototaip, dan mengenal pasti "
"aplikasi awal. Disyorkan untuk mempunyai pakar dalam pengkomputeran kuantum "
"dan dalam bidang aplikasi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Project manager/team lead and support:** A leadership role focused on "
"technical implementation. This person manages technical aspects of internal "
"and external projects, identifies potential research collaborations, and "
"identifies application and research priorities. Other activities include "
"managing research funds and grants, spearheading outreach, and generally "
"supporting core research functions.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Pengurus projek/ketua pasukan dan sokongan:** Peranan kepimpinan yang "
"tertumpu pada pelaksanaan teknikal. Orang ini mengurus aspek teknikal projek"
" dalaman dan luaran, mengenal pasti kolaborasi penyelidikan yang berpotensi,"
" dan mengenal pasti keutamaan aplikasi dan penyelidikan. Aktiviti lain "
"termasuk mengurus dana dan geran penyelidikan, menerajui jangkauan, dan "
"secara umum menyokong fungsi penyelidikan teras.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Business SME:** Team member(s) who explore partnership opportunities, "
"develop the local quantum ecosystem, and who identify potential application "
"areas and funding opportunities.\n"
msgstr ""
"**SME Perniagaan:** Ahli pasukan yang meneroka peluang perkongsian, "
"membangunkan ekosistem kuantum tempatan, dan mengenal pasti bidang aplikasi "
"dan peluang pembiayaan yang berpotensi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| At year zero (just starting up)       |      Recommended minimum FTE         |\n"
"| -------------------------- | ----------------- |\n"
"| Executive sponsor          | 0.25 FTE      |\n"
"| Project manager            | 1.0 FTE         |\n"
"| Subject matter expert      | 2.0 FTE         |\n"
"| Business SME               | 1.0 FTE        |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Pada tahun sifar (baru bermula) | Minimum FTE yang disyorkan |\n"
"| -------------------------- | ----------------- |\n"
"| Penaja eksekutif | 0.25 FTE |\n"
"| Pengurus projek | 1.0 FTE |\n"
"| Pakar kandungan | 2.0 FTE |\n"
"| SME Perniagaan | 1.0 FTE |\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Startups {#startups}"
msgstr "Syarikat permulaan {#startups}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Startups have a wide variety of structures. Subject matter expertise and "
"technical leadership will always be important. Here we also assume that "
"business development is a priority.\n"
msgstr ""
"Syarikat permulaan mempunyai pelbagai struktur. Kepakaran kandungan dan "
"kepimpinan teknikal sentiasa penting. Di sini kita juga mengandaikan bahawa "
"pembangunan perniagaan adalah keutamaan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Business SME:** Team member(s) who explore partnership opportunities, "
"develop the local quantum ecosystem, and identify potential application "
"areas and funding opportunities.\n"
msgstr ""
"**SME Perniagaan:** Ahli pasukan yang meneroka peluang perkongsian, "
"membangunkan ekosistem kuantum tempatan, dan mengenal pasti bidang aplikasi "
"dan peluang pembiayaan yang berpotensi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
