"| -------------------------- | ----------------- |\n"
"| Project manager            | 1.0 FTE           |\n"
"| Subject matter expert      | 2.0 FTE           |\n"
"| Business SME               | 1.0 FTE           |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Pada tahun sifar (baru bermula) | Minimum FTE yang disyorkan |\n"
"| -------------------------- | ----------------- |\n"
"| Pengurus projek | 1.0 FTE |\n"
"| Pakar kandungan | 2.0 FTE |\n"
"| SME Perniagaan | 1.0 FTE |\n"

